sequenceDiagram
    participant ODH as ODH Operator
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant FMO as feast-module-operator<br/>Controller
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>/manifests/
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over ODH,FMO: Flow 1: FeastOperator Reconciliation

    ODH->>K8s: Create FeastOperator CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    K8s-->>FMO: Watch event: FeastOperator created<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token

    FMO->>K8s: Read FeastOperator CR spec<br/>(OIDC config, desired state)
    K8s-->>FMO: FeastOperator spec

    FMO->>K8s: Read odh-feastoperator-config ConfigMap<br/>(platform version)
    K8s-->>FMO: ConfigMap data

    Note over FMO: Action pipeline executes:<br/>initialize -> upgradeIfNeeded -><br/>setKustomizedParams -> releases -><br/>reconcilePlatformVersion -><br/>kustomize.render -> deploy

    FMO->>FS: Read kustomize manifests<br/>Inject OIDC_ISSUER_URL, image params
    FS-->>FMO: Rendered manifests

    Note over FMO: Platform-aware overlay:<br/>ODH -> opendatahub namespace<br/>RHOAI -> redhat-ods-applications

    FMO->>K8s: Apply rendered manifests<br/>(Deployments, RBAC, CRDs, Services,<br/>ServiceMonitor)
    K8s-->>FMO: Resources created/updated

    FMO->>K8s: Update FeastOperator CR status<br/>(conditions, release versions)
    K8s-->>FMO: Status updated

    Note over FMO: migrateDeploymentSelector:<br/>Deletes stale Deployments with<br/>changed immutable selectors

    Note over FMO: gc: Finalizer cleans cluster-scoped<br/>resources (ClusterRoles,<br/>ClusterRoleBindings) by label

    Note over Prom,FMO: Flow 2: Metrics Collection

    Prom->>FMO: GET /metrics<br/>Port: 8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Auth: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    Note over FMO: kube-rbac-proxy validates<br/>token and authorization
    FMO-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics response
